# Mutation plan for the plugin environment (environment.go, supervisor.go, FindManifest).
#
#   MUTATE_PACKAGE=mm-plugin scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/mm-plugin-environment.plan
#
# Every line filters to `environment`: the Go-vs-Rust script in tests/environment.rs and the unit
# tests in environment::tests. Not planned: the state set to running before OnActivate, which no
# plugin here observes, and `activate`'s error reset, which a fresh registration already makes.
# Also not planned: the status path taken from the bundle rather than from Dir(ManifestPath),
# which survived the first run as an equivalent mutant: FindManifest only reads <bundle>/plugin.*,
# so the two are always the same path. CONTROL- lines must SURVIVE.
#
# env-activate-keeps-old-registration survived its first full run: nothing showed which bundle a
# re-activation registered. The script now rewrites ok's manifest before the restart and records
# the version Active() reports, and the line is caught.
#
# 2026-09-18: 17 run, 16 caught (the one above on its re-run); both controls survived.

